      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "MANILA FRANKY (5) scored (25.70) last time out at Hobart adding to an already respectable career. Solid record here including three wins. Winner at his latest appearance in the quickest time on the card. Looks a key chance if runs up to latest figure. KLONDIKE CLYDE (1) has hit the frame here at the last two runs, most recently finishing second beaten 5 lengths (29.55). Looks well placed over the extra ground. Didn't win last time but still ran one of the quickest times on the card. Will give a great sight again. CANYA DO IT (3) turned in a plain run last time when sixth at Hobart over 461m behind MANILA FRANKY (26.85) in a Grade 4/5. Was in the money prior to that. Has ability and is one of the better chances. ARCADIAN RUBY (2) can finish much closer after missing a cheque at this track last start.",
